{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Scanpy 1.11.2 的 UMAP 文档说明，较小的 min_dist 会产生更聚集/成团的嵌入，使流形上邻近的点被拉得更近。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Smaller values\n        will result in a more clustered/clumped embedding where nearby points on\n        the manifold are drawn closer together"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 min_dist=0.05 属于较小的取值，因此拟写结论“使邻近嵌入点看起来更成团”与文档描述方向一致。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:min_dist",
        "user:proposed_conclusion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：文档同时说明 min_dist 应相对 spread 设置，spread 决定嵌入点展开的尺度；仅凭 min_dist=0.05 不能判断实际成团程度。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "The value should be set relative to\n        the ``spread`` value, which determines the scale at which embedded\n        points will be spread out."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
